stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft
  draft --> preview: editor saves revision
  preview --> draft: request changes
  preview --> approved: publisher reviews
  approved --> published: atomic publish pointer
  published --> draft: create new revision
  published --> archived: edition retired
  archived --> published: authorized restore
  published --> rolled_back: restore earlier snapshot
  rolled_back --> published: publish rollback snapshot
  note right of published: Visitors see only immutable publication revision
